GsMonkArmor.EndowLine: Zen Thunder: standing within your own Lightning Aura enters zen; every fourth melee or summon strike in zen unleashes a piercing thunder-palm wave
GsMonkShinobiArmor.EndowLine: Zen Thunder, Shinobi: zen palms come every third strike, and each wave splits two side palms on its first hit
GsSquireArmor.EndowLine: Oath Bulwark: taking a hit raises the oath shield for five seconds; melee strikes during it hurl a gilded oath lance from your shoulder
GsSquireValhallaArmor.EndowLine: Oath Bulwark, Valhalla: the shield holds six seconds and every strike hurls twin oath lances
GsHuntressArmor.EndowLine: Snare the Prey: enemies caught in your explosive traps are marked; ranged hits on marked prey call two thorn bolts from the flanks
GsHuntressRedRidingArmor.EndowLine: Snare the Prey, Red Riding: marked prey draws three venom-tipped thorn bolts instead
GsApprenticeArmor.EndowLine: Kindlecraft: your Flameburst tower's hits build kindling; at six stacks the next magic hit unfolds a fire glyph over the target, raining three ember bolts
GsApprenticeDarkArtistArmor.EndowLine: Kindlecraft, Dark Artist: five stacks suffice, and the glyph turns to shadowflame, raining four shadow embers
